      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Offshore Petroleum and Greenhouse Gas Storage (Regulatory Levies) Act 2003</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 3 September 2021</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
