              <heading>Section 3</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>remedial direction</i></b> means a direction under <ref href="#sec-586">section 586</ref>, 586A, 587, 587A, 591B, 592, 594A or 595 of the <i>Offshore Petroleum and Greenhouse Gas Storage Act 2006</i>.</p>
                  <p><b><i>State</i></b><b><i>/</i></b><b><i>Territory remedial direction</i></b> means a direction under a provision of a State PSLA or Territory PSLA that substantially corresponds to <ref href="#sec-586">section 586</ref>, 586A, 587, 587A, 591B, 592, 594A or 595 of the <i>Offshore Petroleum and Greenhouse Gas Storage Act 2006</i>.</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2">
